# A password whose middle two letters are level 5's and whose outer two are
# no count's.
#
# The grid has the ten digits and the alphabet has none, so a digit can
# never match. `$82:B018` finds the level, tries all ten counts and turns it
# down: level 1, carry set, and the first and third letters left swapped.
# The game then starts at level 1, which is what frame 2990 shows.
#
# Regenerate with:
#
#     python tools/make_password_movie.py 0HR0 > movies/password-no-count.zmv
#
# and put this comment back.
